e shelf life (8 and 6 days) is longer than the 2-day order cycle. It only costs a little storage.\n- So it pays to order somewhat above the forecast. Average demand is about 1.046× the forecast, and daily swings are large.\n- Candidate 1 orders exactly the forecast, so it is short on average: penalties plus lost sales.\n- Candidate 4 orders about 30% extra. The surplus builds up until it spoils, and with roughly 140 units arriving at once it sometimes overflows the warehouse.\n- The best zone looks like 1.1–1.2×: candidates 6, 3, 0 and 7.\n\n**Estimated ranking:** 6 > 3 > 0 > 7, then 2 ≈ 4 > 1 > 5. The 4th–6th places (7, 2, 4) are the least certain."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4390, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4390}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:06:56.686Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVPs892rLCAUacYGQyLi"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01D4vRy7vQATL7bAiPsmRt8v", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVPs8ReRtCmizB2nPjGq", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01D4vRy7vQATL7bAiPsmRt8v", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.65, 0.3, 0.38, 0.72, 0.35, 0.15, 0.8, 0.62]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_deta